                "textId": "Performance_1999990015_1917485757_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "还有，你的甲……咳，大兜丸，\n我刚才看见，他往北边飞去了。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990015_1917485757_content",
                "value": "还有，你的甲……咳，大兜丸，\n我刚才看见，他往北边飞去了。",
